        "TileImage": "$($repository fa0b9f07-d667-48d2-99c0-c5ee905fa973).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47.\r\rYour destination is the ancestral Dartmoor Manor in England. Your Targets are none other than the entire Carlisle Family and their butler; Mr Fernsby, as the client has a... disliking for the man.\r\rThe Carlisles intend to restart Providence anew and we cannot let that happen.\r\rGod knows how Alexa Carlisle is still alive... Maybe she had some sort of Totem of Undying? So in order to have her stay dead we reccomend eliminating her witha Shotgun.",
